<title>BAHRAIN: Bahrain Commercial Facilities  Q1 net up.</title>
<headline>Bahrain Commercial Facilities  Q1 net up.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		     (million Bahraini dinars)</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.42    vs    0.32</p>
<p> Sales income	   3.67    vs    3.36</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds 16.51    vs   16.37</p>
